ki private IP bo'lishi mumkin emas","Ha, birinchi uch oktet teng"],"answer":"B","explanation":"/26 blok qadami 64: 4 va 67 turli bloklarda.","source":"M11, 172--179-betlar; hisoblash mashqi","code":"S6.NET.03","visual":""},{"id":"TAR-05-011","ch":5,"fmt":"Y1","lev":"B","stem":"255.255.248.0 uzluksiz IPv4 maskasiga mos CIDR prefiks qaysi?","options":["/22","/20","/21","/23"],"answer":"C","explanation":"Maskaning ikkilik ko‘rinishida 21 ta 1 bit bor.","source":"M11, 172--179-betlar; texnik aniqlashtirish: RFC 4632","code":"S6.NET.03","visual":""},{"id":"TAR-05-012","ch":5,"fmt":"Y1","lev":"B","stem":"IPv4 manzili 192.168.3.256 deb yozilgan. Nima xato?","options":["192 bilan boshlanishiga ruxsat yo'q","IPv4da aynan uchta oktet kerak","IPv4 faqat hex belgilardan tuziladi","Oxirgi oktet 0--255 oralig'idan chiqdi"],"answer":"D","explanation":"IPv4 har okteti 8 bit, 256 ifodalanmaydi.","source":"M11, 172--179-betlar","code":"S6.NET.03","visual":""},{"id":"TAR-05-013","ch":5,"fmt":"Y1","lev":"C","stem":"255.255.255.128 uzluksiz IPv4 maskasiga mos CIDR prefiks qaysi?","options":["/25","/27","/26","/24"],"answer":"A","explanation":"Maskaning ikkilik ko‘rinishida 25 ta 1 bit bor.","source":"M11, 172--179-betlar; texnik aniqlashtirish: RFC 4632","code":"S6.NET.03","visual":""},{"id":"TAR-05-014","ch":5,"fmt":"Y1","lev":"C","stem":"255.255.255.224 uzluksiz IPv4 maskasiga mos CIDR prefiks qaysi?","options":["/28","/27","1-a, 2-c, 3-b","/26"],"answer":"B","explanation":"Maskaning ikkilik ko‘rinishida 27 ta 1 bit bor.","source":"M11, 172--179-betlar; texnik aniqlashtirish: RFC 4632","code":"S6.NET.03","visual":""},{"id":"TAR-05-015","ch":5,"fmt":"Y1","lev":"E","stem":"192.168.12.22/27 IP yozuvida subnet maskasi qaysi?","options":["255.255.255.240","255.0.255.0","255.255.255.224","255.255.255.192"],"answer":"C","explanation":"/27 prefiks uchun 27 ta 1 bit ketma-ket joylashadi, niqob 255.255.255.224.","source":"M11, 172--179-betlar; texnik aniqlashtirish: RFC 4632","code":"S6.NET.03"